      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Perimeter fence for new homesteads and working ranches along the I-35 corridor south of Waco. Free written estimates, real per-foot pricing, and crews that know black clay.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
